{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36258","headline":"再题龙泉寺上方 · 方干","name":"再题龙泉寺上方","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"牛斗正齐羣木末，鸟行横截衆山腰。\n路盘砌下兼穿竹，井在岩头亦统潮。\n海岸四更看日出，石房三月任花烧。\n未能割得繁华去，难向此中甘寂寥。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"方干","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_36258.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36258","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}